{
  "comment": [
    "The ladybug shared library, pinned to a release and to the exact bytes of",
    "each platform's archive. fetch.sh downloads the one that matches the host",
    "and refuses anything whose checksum does not match.",
    "",
    "It is a prebuilt library rather than a source build because the point here",
    "is to measure the engine people install, and because building the C++ tree",
    "from source is what kept kuzu out of this suite in the first place."
